http://example.com -> scheme=http host=example.com port=80 path=/ query= | http://example.com/
HTTPS://Example.COM/A/b?x=1&y=2#frag -> scheme=https host=example.com port=443 path=/A/b query=x=1&y=2 | https://example.com/A/b?x=1&y=2
http://user:pass@host.test:8080/p -> scheme=http host=host.test port=8080 path=/p query= | http://host.test:8080/p
https://[::1]:8443/v6?q -> scheme=https host=::1 port=8443 path=/v6 query=q | https://[::1]:8443/v6?q
http://[2001:DB8::1]/ -> scheme=http host=2001:db8::1 port=80 path=/ query= | http://[2001:db8::1]/
http://127.0.0.1:80/same-port -> scheme=http host=127.0.0.1 port=80 path=/same-port query= | http://127.0.0.1/same-port
https://h/a b/é?q=a b -> scheme=https host=h port=443 path=/a%20b/%C3%A9 query=q=a%20b | https://h/a%20b/%C3%A9?q=a%20b
ws://chat.test/socket -> scheme=ws host=chat.test port=80 path=/socket query= | ws://chat.test/socket
ftp://files.test/x -> scheme=ftp host=files.test port=0 path=/x query= | ftp://files.test/x
http://h:/empty-port -> scheme=http host=h port=80 path=/empty-port query= | http://h/empty-port
example.com/no-scheme -> invalid
http:/one-slash -> invalid
http:// -> invalid
http://bad host/ -> invalid
http://h:99999/ -> invalid
http://h:0/ -> invalid
http://h:8x/ -> invalid
http://[::1/ -> invalid
http://[1.2.3.4]/ -> invalid
crlf in path -> 0
del in path -> 0
null -> 0
resolve g -> http://a/b/c/g
resolve ./g -> http://a/b/c/g
resolve g/ -> http://a/b/c/g/
resolve /g -> http://a/g
resolve //g -> http://g/
resolve ?y -> http://a/b/c/d;p?y
resolve g?y -> http://a/b/c/g?y
resolve #s -> http://a/b/c/d;p?q
resolve  -> http://a/b/c/d;p?q
resolve . -> http://a/b/c/
resolve ./ -> http://a/b/c/
resolve .. -> http://a/b/
resolve ../ -> http://a/b/
resolve ../g -> http://a/b/g
resolve ../.. -> http://a/
resolve ../../g -> http://a/g
resolve ../../../g -> http://a/g
resolve /./g -> http://a/g
resolve /../g -> http://a/g
resolve g/../h -> http://a/b/c/h
resolve https://other.test/x -> https://other.test/x
resolve other?k=v -> http://[::1]:8080/dir/other?k=v
